description	"Artillery Stormtrooper

A master of indirect fire and bombardment.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (2)
-- Based On Clone Pistol
-- 20% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 20% Faster RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Universal Grenade Launcher
-- Staggers/Cripples On Hit


^8Attributes:
- 15% less knockback Taken
- Getup (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Blast Armor"